WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Add to the end of a list

2
00:00:02.852 --> 00:00:06.427
A list variable keeps many entries. Name it Journal.

3
00:00:07.288 --> 00:00:11.163
On the Describe screen, a new event. AddButton is clicked.

4
00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.730
Its action is in Lists. Add to the end of list, with what was typed.

5
00:00:28.853 --> 00:00:33.403
Each click adds one entry at the end. Next, go to the Journal screen.
